---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import TodayPanel from '../components/TodayPanel.astro';
---
<Base title="Today" description="The season, the color, and one small task for the day.">
  <p class="rubric sc">Today</p>
  <h1>One thing for today</h1>
  <div class="home">
    <TodayPanel />
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The task takes a few minutes. There is nothing to keep up and nothing to lose by skipping a day.</p>
      <p>If you want the Mass readings for the day as the Church assigns them, the United States bishops post them each morning at <a href="https://bible.usccb.org/daily-bible-reading">bible.usccb.org</a>. The readings here are a separate cycle of thirty, chosen to be short.</p>
      <p>The season and the color at the top of every page follow the Church's calendar for the Roman Rite.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
